00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:15.400
The fund says the central bank should bring inflation back to target within two to three years.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.420
It pairs that aim with a medium-term fiscal framework. Nigeria's growth has held up,

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:25.360
the fund says, because the country exports energy. Living costs there remain very high.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:29.780
Heavy spending on artificial intelligence is helping keep global growth afloat, the

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:30.340
fund says.

